From: noname713705 <noname713705@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:54:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Build Gradle 2.0 with Gradle 1.0 (no docs, no tests)

Alternate build files in the Gradle 1.0 DSL (settings.gradle.1.0 and
*.gradle.1.0), the original build files are untouched. buildSrc/settings.gradle
selects buildSrc/build.gradle.1.0 only when the running Gradle is 1.0.
Downloads go through scripts/maven-proxy.py (Gradle 1.0 on Java 7 sends no SNI).
default-imports.txt is generated in core (docs project not built).
Maven Central URL: https, no trailing slash.

Run: -c settings.gradle.1.0 clean :distributions:explodedDist

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
